    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108097" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόβαθ-ρα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plinth, pedestal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Supp.Epigr.
				6.319
			</span></i> (Laodicea Combusta). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῶν συλλογισμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.166
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				71
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ τῶν ἄλλων τεχνῶν ὑ. τε καὶ ἀρχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.Quint.
					3.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὕλη ὑ. καὶ ἕδρα δοκεῖ τῷ εἴδει
					εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.3.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Anat.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβάθραι</span>
			<i>stages</i> in the pursuit of virtue, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				40.4
			</span></i>.</div>
